  << /ActualText (ETOSO\056AI \057 Lead Product Designer \0502025\0232026\051\nSustainability intelligence startup\054 HQ\072 London\054 UK\n\nData tool for exploring the sustainability practices and benchmark performances \024 all extracted from public company reports\056 Took over an early product concept from a creative agency and shaped it into a launch\055ready product together with the PM \024 defining product structure\054 core workflows and UX\054 and driving design through several subsequent pivots\056 Also designed the website and marketing assets\056)
