  << /ActualText (SODA\056AUTO \057 Principal PRODUCT Designer \0502022\0232025\051\nAutomotive engineering software\054 HQ\072 London\054 UK\n\nSole product designer across a suite of tools covering the automotive software development and validation lifecycle \024 requirements management\054 systems architecture\054 test design\054 vehicle software configuration and configuring test runs for a connected hardware validation rig\056\n\nWorked directly with engineering lead and founder\054 with substantial ownership of product concepts\054 workflows and feature decisions from zero to launch\056 Also owned brand\054 website and marketing design hands\055on\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1255 0 R
