1264 0 obj
  << /ActualText (JAMI \057 Product Design Lead \0502013\0232015\051\n\nLeading the total redesign of mobile application for our client \024 Russian Post \050primary mail service in Russia\051\056 From sketching client\031s ideas to consulting developers on the construction stage\056 App Store app rating soared from 2 to nearly 5 after redesign launch\056\n\nLed the product design direction across platforms\072 designed the iOS experience hands\055on and guided other designers adapting it for Android and Windows\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1265 0 R
     /Pg 1240 0 R
     /S /Span
